# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw vendor data
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The OptionsDX SPY end-of-day option chain files (~600 MB across 2010-2023).
# Excluded for two reasons: they are far too large for GitHub, and we do not
# hold redistribution rights. See the "Getting the data" section of README.md
# for where to download them.
data/*.parquet

# The Databento OPRA pull for the 2025-2026 second reference period (~363 MB:
# per-day CBBO-1m quote snapshots and per-day instrument definitions). Same two
# reasons as above -- too large for GitHub, and not ours to redistribute. The
# patterns above are single-level globs and do not reach into this subtree, so
# it needs its own entry. Reproduce it with
#   python3 databento_pullers/databento_pull_2025_2026.py all
data/raw_databento_2025_2026/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Derived caches
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything in data/ that is not a raw parquet file is a cache this project
# generated from those files. It is reproducible by running the pipeline, so it
# is not source and does not belong in version control.
data/*.csv

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS and editor noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.ipynb_checkpoints/
